  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "So arrived in the post the new <a href=\"@sand-scoops-for-metal-detecting/\" data-kind=\"internal\">Neptune carbon fibre sandscoop handle</a>, i get through so many types of <a href=\"@sand-scoops-for-metal-detecting/\" data-kind=\"internal\">handles on my scoops</a>, the only one i havent broken is the stainless one, but it weighs a ton."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "I spoke to Anderson Shafts and they assure me i shouldnt break it."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "I do like a challenge...."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Weight wise this is very light and also stiff, so im not sure how this is going to work on the wet sand, i shall be testing out this week, already had a couple of hours with it on the dry sand and it sure does seem tough.."
  },
